     A*
     A* - CONCENTRA Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 05/12/2003 by C:62 for Project 129MBO
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from CONCENTRA.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PN901                     TEXT('CONCENTRA Bill Trans Info')
     A            N9DCID    R               REFFLD(DCID)
     A                                      COLHDG('IMPORT Doc ID')
     A            N9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAN0P file member')
     A            N9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAM9P record created
     A*
     A            N9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            N9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAN0P
     A*           member to FAN1P
     A*
     A            N9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            N9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAN1P records have a value
     A*           in N1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the Import document from being processed again.
     A*
     A            N9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            N9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            N9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            N9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            N9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            N9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            N9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            N9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            N9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            N9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
